        "argv": [
          "go",
          "test",
          "-json",
          "-count=1",
          ".",
          "-run",
          "^TestUnion_refusesBranchesThatAgreeOnlyOnTheGoResultType$"
        ]
      },
      "note": [
        "The semantic probe is the comparator's own matrix, at the level of the",
        "function that was changed. The killer is the public guarantee that the Go",
        "result type R is not the compatibility rule: its two branches build the same",
        "string out of a text column and a nullable one, so the compiler is satisfied",
        "and only the shape comparison can refuse them."
