          "test",
          "-json",
          "-count=1",
          ".",
          "-run",
          "^TestCompare_refusesEveryMismatchWithoutWidening$"
        ]
      },
      "killer": {
        "expect": [
          "TestUnion_refusesIncompatibleBranchesWhenTheUnionIsBuilt"
        ],
        "argv": [
          "go",
          "test",
          "-json",
          "-count=1",
          ".",
          "-run",
          "^TestUnion_refusesIncompatibleBranchesWhenTheUnionIsBuilt$"
        ]
      },
      "note": [
        "The mutation is a weakening rather than a deletion: deleting the check would",
        "index past the end of the shorter shape and panic, which any test catches for",
        "the wrong reason. A weakening produces a union that builds, renders and is",
        "wrong, which is what has to be caught."
      ],
